Description: enable V-Sync and default to the X11 video driver
 Add a new main() entry point which sets SDL_VIDEODRIVER=x11 with
 setenv() (a value given by the user still wins, this replaces the former
 Debian launcher script), calls SDL_Init and sets SDL_GL_SWAP_CONTROL
 before the original code calls SDL_SetVideoMode, then jumps to the
 original entry point, renamed pinp_main.
 .
 The new code and strings live in their own sections (.text.startup and
 .rodata): the synth reads code bytes as noise and addresses its loop
 counters relative to the song data, so adding anything to the original
 .text or .data changes the music and makes the intro quit after a few
 seconds.
Author: Nicolas HOUDELOT <nicolas@demosdebs.org>
Assisted-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Forwarded: not-needed
